Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.56,0:08:58.01,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}3. ENTREGAS DE AVIÃO
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.71,0:08:39.31,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}#3 AVIÃO
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.31,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}PALPITE: a conferir
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:00.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Número dois: bancos pequenos e lojas de
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:01.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,empréstimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:04.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Lembra que o GTA 6 é a história de um casal de
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:05.29,Legenda,,0,0,0,,assaltantes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:06.01,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Pois é.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No meio do capítulo três abrem os assaltos a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:11.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,bancos pequenos e lojas de empréstimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Pagam de cinco a quarenta e cinco mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Anota essa que vale ouro: tem um item que
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:18.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,bloqueia o pacote de tinta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:21.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Sem ele, parte do dinheiro sai manchado e vale
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:21.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,menos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:24.04,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Com ele, você leva tudo limpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:25.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E aqui a Lucia faz diferença: com os dois no
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.39,Legenda,,0,0,0,,assalto, ela ajuda a carregar as bolsas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:29.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais bolsa, mais dinheiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:33.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Outra coisa: antes de entrar, olha a rota de
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:34.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fuga no mapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:37.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Banco perto de ponte ou de canal é ótimo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,porque dá pra fugir de barco, e, pelo que eu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:42.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,vi até agora, a polícia na água pega bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,no seu pé do que no asfalto.
